	   <h2>Official description</h2> 
	      <div id="description-wrapper" class="description-wrapper">
        <div id="description-content" class="description-content" data-nosnippet>	 
            As a degewo tenant, you can now use our free degewo app. Regardless of whether you are flexibly on the go or conveniently from home – you can access all the information in your rental agreement at any time via your smartphone or tablet.<br><br>The advantages of the &quot;Meine degewo&quot; app:<br>Contracts: View all the data on your rental contract and the composition of the rent. Request individual rental documents quickly and easily.<br>Consumption: Compare your current consumption values ​​for heating, hot water and cold water with previous months and years.<br>Messages: If you have any concerns, simply write to us using our contact form and track the processing status.			        </div>
		<p class="source-note">Source: Official app description retrieved from <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.aareon.meinedegewo&hl=en" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">Google Play</a>. Provided for reference only.</p>	
